# ADR 0029 unified Pi factory — fetched/cached, NOT vendored (re-fetched + digest-verified from
# base/drivers/SOURCES.md's pins on every clean build host). rpi-keyring/ and raspberrypi.sources
# are pinned/vendored INPUTS and must stay tracked — do not add them here.
pi-kernel-cache/
pi-firmware-cache/
hookprobe-os-pi.img
