# sign-and-sbom.sh sidecar outputs (security/local-release/) — not secret themselves, but
# this build is undisclosed so far; keep everything image-derived out of any future commit
# until the operator decides otherwise.
*.img.sha256
*.img.sig
*.img.pem
*.img.sbom.cdx.json
*.img.sbom.spdx.json
